# Shell scripts must stay LF everywhere. The punch pipeline's run_pipeline.sh and
# smoke_test.sh execute inside the Cowork Linux VM under dash, which aborts on CRLF
# line endings; with core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout would otherwise rewrite
# them to CRLF. (Hooks no longer ship .sh halves; they run on the Windows host.)
*.sh text eol=lf

# The punch pipeline's Python, JS, JSON and Markdown must also stay LF. Any tool
# that reads and rewrites a CRLF file in text mode converts the whole file to LF
# and produces a diff where every line changed (gen_report.js once showed 1891
# diff lines for 9 real edits). Pin the working format so this stops recurring.
*.py text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
